3:05Z","value":28,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=4960360","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4551870-1847286114043319","game_id":"steam-4551870","kind":"update","title":"Ruffed Up Demo Patch Notes - 2026/10/25","summary":"With Halloween fast approaching (or Howloween?) we wanted to add a bit of festive fright to Ruffed Up alongside some smaller changes.While we're at it, we wanted to give a huge thanks to everyone who's played Ruffed Up during Next Fest! We're hard at work building more content for the full release, so stay tuned!New Features/ContentNew Halloween skybox in lobbyNew Halloween decorations in all levelsBug FixesFixed an issue with controller inputs in customization menus during splitscreen modeAdjus","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-26T00:56:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114043319","verified_at":"2026-10-26T02:53:52Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4551870-1847286114030396","game_id":"steam-4551870","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo Speedrun Contest!","summary":"To celebrate Ruffed Up being a part of Steam Next Fest, we're holding a speedrun contest! The contest will run from the start of Next Fest (October 19, 2026 10:00AM PDT) to the end of the month (October 31, 2026 11:59PM PDT), so start assembling a team of your fastest pups and practicing your rescue boosts! How to ParticipateBe a member of the Ruffed Up DiscordEvery participant in the playthrough must be a member of the Discord! This is how we will track unique entries.Record a playthrough video","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T21:30:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114030396","verified_at":"2026-10-21T23:11:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4551870-1846651706691564","game_id":"steam-4551870","kind":"announcement","title":"🐶Ruffed Up is in Steam Next Fest: October 2026 Edition!🎉","summary":"Your dog walker is unconscious. You're 2-4 dogs. Drag your walker through the streets of Slop Friendcisco and KEEP THEM SAFE!We're part of Steam Next Fest! 🎉Play the free demo now on Steam that includes the first 3 levels of the game, and wishlist the game if you like what you see!To celebrate this, we're hosting a speedrun contest on our official Discord! Contest winners will receive free keys to the full version of the game, so join the Discord to find out how you can participate!See you in Sl","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:05:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691564","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:50:53Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4551870-1846018067931970","game_id":"steam-4551870","kind":"update","title":"Ruffed Up Demo Patch Notes - 2026/10/08","summary":"Hello all! In preparation for the upcoming Steam Next Fest, we've updated our demo build with some new content! Please check it out!New Features/ContentAdded walker customizationWalker skintone, hair color, hairstyle, hat and outfit can be customized by interacting with the walker in the lobbyAdded unlockable dog customization optionsNew sections have been added to Park New sections have been added to CitySections in Factory have been re-arranged Bug FixesFixed issues related to controller input","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-09T02:23:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067931970","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:50:53Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4551870-1846018067924889","game_id":"steam-4551870","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update Incoming!","summary":"Hello everyone! We're pleased to announce that we'll soon be updating the Ruffed Up Demo in preparation for the upcoming October Steam Next Fest! In the meantime, here's a sneak peek of some of the new features we've been working on… With this new demo build, we're also looking to hold a speedrun contest in the Discord for the chance to win free game keys! Join our Discord here in order to stay updated on the format of the contest. Happy barking!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-07T03:36:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067924889","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:50:53Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4551870-1840944183785069","game_id":"steam-4551870","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch Notes 8/16/2026","summary":"Hello everyone! Thank you so much for playing the Ruffed Up demo. We're happy to announce we've hit 12,000+ wishlists! We couldn't have done this without your support.This demo update comes with a hotly-requested new feature - Photo Mode! Feel free to tag us when posting on social media, or join our Discord and share your pics there! We're looking forward to seeing the creative images you guys will undoubtedly make.Demo Patch Notes 8/16/2026New FeaturesAdded Photo Mode to the gameAdded Vietnames","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-17T03:35:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183785069","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:50:53Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4551870-1840944183773084","game_id":"steam-4551870","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch Notes 8/12/2026","summary":"Hello everyone! Thank you again for playing the demo, wishlisting the game and leaving feedback! We're happy (?) to announce that since the demo was released, our players have collectively mortally wounded their unconscious walker over 300,000 times!The response to the game has surpassed all expectations and we're working hard to make it an even better experience. In this patch, we've made some adjustments that should improve some difficulties players have been having in certain sections, as wel","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-12T06:05:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183773084","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:50:53Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4551870-1840310314349696","game_id":"steam-4551870","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo Bug Fixes - 8/9/2026","summary":"Hey, all! First of all, we want to give a huge thanks to everyone who's played our demo, wishlisted the full game, or left feedback. We've been thrilled to see the community's response to our game! Based on feedback from the demo, we've made some improvements and fixes that should make things a bit smoother.FixesFixed an issue where cars in Park were not being synced between host and clientsFixed an issue where dog outlines were showing inconsistently when the dog was obscuredFixed an issue wher","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-09T18:37:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314349696","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:50:53Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4551870":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:52:31Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:52:31Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4551870":"2026-10-26T12:52:31Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"45518